&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;okuma süresi: 10 minutes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atarsınız`./gradlew build`, terminal 3 dakika boyunca bloklanıyor ve başka bir şey yapmanız gerekiyor _beklerken? Yeni bir sekme açmanıza gerek yok.`Ctrl+Z`süreç askıya alır,`fg`Tam olarak siz bıraktığınız yere geri getirir. Bir geliştiricinin günlük yaşamındaki en düşüğün değerlendirilen Unix ipucu.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;dlist&quot;&gt;
&lt;dl&gt;
&lt;dt class=&quot;hdlist1&quot;&gt;tik&lt;/dt&gt;
&lt;dd&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/dd&gt;
&lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun_meşgul_bir_terminal&quot;&gt;Sorun: meşgul bir terminal&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her geliştirici bu durumu yaşamıştır :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Terminal kilitlendi. Artık hiçbir komut yazamazsınız. Ve bir dosyayı görüntülemek, birini çalıştırmak ihtiyacınız var.&lt;code&gt;git status&lt;/code&gt;, veya bir meşgul portu kontrol et.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

actor Développeur as dev
participant &quot;terminal&quot; as term
participant &quot;Gradle
 ( süreç )&quot; as gradle

dev -&amp;gt; term : ./gradlew build
term -&amp;gt; gradle : Lance le build
gradle -&amp;gt; term : Occupe le terminal\n(pas de prompt)
dev -&amp;gt; term : veut taper une commande
term --&amp;gt; dev : ❌ Terminal bloqué

note right of dev
  Le développeur est
  paralysé pendant
  toute la durée du build
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çoğu geliştirici yeni bir terminal açar. Ancak daha zarif, daha hızlı ve yerli bir çözüm vardır: iş yönetimi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_üç_zorunlu_komut&quot;&gt;Üç zorunlu komut&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ctrlz_askıya_alma_sigtstp&quot;&gt;Ctrl+Z — Askıya alma (SIGTSTP)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`Ctrl+Z`sinyal gönderir`SIGTSTP`süreç ön planda. süreç&lt;strong&gt;askıya alınmış&lt;/strong&gt;ölmedi — ve terminal komut istemini yeniden alır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew build
$&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Köşeli parantezler arasındaki sayı`[1]`dir&lt;strong&gt;iş numarası&lt;/strong&gt;. Le `+`varsayılan işi gösterir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_fg_öne_al&quot;&gt;fg — Öne al&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`fg`askıya alınan işi ön plana getirir. İşlem, durduğu yerden tam olarak devam eder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ fg
./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building... (reprend où il en était)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Belirli bir iş numarasıyla :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ fg %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bg_arka_planda_devam_et&quot;&gt;bg — Arka planda devam et&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`bg`Terminali bloke etmeden işlemi devam ettir. Uzun derlemeler için ideal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ bg
[1]+ ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
$&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le `&amp;amp;`sonunda, işlemin arka planda çalıştığı anlamına gelir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_jobs_shell_işlerini_listelemek&quot;&gt;jobs` — Shell işlerini listelemek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ jobs
[1]-  Stoppé    vim README.md
[2]+  En cours   ./gradlew build&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

state &quot;Ön plan\n(bloke terminal)&quot; as fg #LightCoral
state &quot;Askıya alınmış\n(Ctrl+Z)&quot; as stopped #LightYellow
state &quot;Arka plan
(bg)&quot; as bg_ #LightGreen

[*] --&amp;gt; fg : Lance une commande
fg --&amp;gt; stopped : Ctrl+Z\n(SIGTSTP)
stopped --&amp;gt; fg : fg\nreprend en avant-plan
stopped --&amp;gt; bg_ : bg\nreprend en arrière-plan
bg_ --&amp;gt; fg : fg\nramène en avant-plan
fg --&amp;gt; [*] : Commande terminée

note right of stopped
  Le processus est figé
  mais _pas_ tué
end note

note left of bg_
  Le terminal est libre
  le build continue
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_1_uzun_derleme&quot;&gt;Senaryo 1: Uzun derleme&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu en yaygın kullanım durumu. Gradle buildi başlatıyorsunuz, terminal kilitlenir ve başka bir şey yapmanız gerekir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
autonumber

actor Développeur as dev
participant &quot;Uçbirim&quot; as term
participant &quot;Gradle&quot; as gradle
database &quot;Durum
süreç&quot; as state

dev -&amp;gt; term : ./gradlew build
term -&amp;gt; gradle : Lance le build
gradle -&amp;gt; state : En cours (FG)
dev -&amp;gt; term : Ctrl+Z
term -&amp;gt; state : Suspendu (job [1])
term --&amp;gt; dev : Prompt libre $

dev -&amp;gt; term : git status
term --&amp;gt; dev : working tree clean

dev -&amp;gt; term : fg
term -&amp;gt; state : Reprend (FG)
gradle --&amp;gt; dev : Build réussi ✓

note right of state
  Le processus Gradle
  n&#39;a jamais été tué
  Il reprend exactement
  où il s&#39;était arrêté
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_adım_adım&quot;&gt;Adım adım&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew build

$ git status
On branch main
nothing to commit, working tree clean

$ fg
./gradlew build
&amp;gt; Building...
BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 2m 34s&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_2_unutulan_editör&quot;&gt;Senaryo 2: Unutulan editör&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Siz içinde`vim`, başka bir dosyayı &lt;em&gt;sans&lt;/em&gt; incelemeniz gerekiyor`vim`.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Dans vim, en mode commande :
:shell
$ cat /path/to/other/file.txt
$ exit
# Retour dans vim&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ama ağır. İle`Ctrl+Z`, hemen olur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Dans vim, n&#39;importe quel moment :
Ctrl+Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim README.md

$ cat /path/to/other/file.txt
# ... lire le fichier ...

$ fg
vim README.md
# Retour exact là où on en était, curseur en place&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
autonumber

actor Développeur as dev
participant &quot;vim&quot; as vim
participant &quot;kabuk&quot; as shell

dev -&amp;gt; vim : édition en cours
dev -&amp;gt; vim : Ctrl+Z
vim -&amp;gt; shell : Suspendu (job [1])
dev -&amp;gt; shell : cat autre_fichier.txt
shell --&amp;gt; dev : contenu du fichier
dev -&amp;gt; shell : fg
shell -&amp;gt; vim : Reprend (job [1])
vim --&amp;gt; dev : Curseur exactement\nà la même position

note right of vim
  vim restaure
  intégralement l&#39;état :
  position du curseur,
  buffer, undo stack
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Note: empty output as no French source provided)`vim`bir &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203; sonrasında durumunu mükemmel şekilde geri yükler`fg`imleç konumu, tampon içeriği, geri alma geçmişi — her şey korunur&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_3_opencode_süreci_askıya_alınmış&quot;&gt;Senaryo 3: Opencode süreci askıya alınmış&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu makaleyi tetikleyen senaryo budur. Kullanıyorsunuz.&lt;code&gt;opencode&lt;/code&gt;(Kendi kodunuz üzerindeki LLM&amp;#8217;yi yönetmek için CLI aracı), ve süreç askıya alındı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Développeur as dev
participant &quot;opencode\n(LLM ajanı)&quot; as agent
participant &quot;kabuk&quot; as shell
participant &quot;git&quot; as git

dev -&amp;gt; agent : Session active
agent -&amp;gt; agent : Tour de parole\ndu LLM en cours

note over agent
  Ctrl+Z arrive
  en plein milieu
  d&#39;une analyse de code
end note

dev -&amp;gt; agent : Ctrl+Z
agent -&amp;gt; shell : Suspendu (job [1])
dev -&amp;gt; git : git diff
git --&amp;gt; dev : changements visibles
dev -&amp;gt; shell : fg
shell -&amp;gt; agent : Reprend (job [1])
agent --&amp;gt; dev : Reprend exactement\nl&#39;analyse en cours

note right of agent
  Aucune perte de contexte
  Le LLM reprend sa réponse
  exactement où il en était
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ opencode
# ... session en cours, LLM analyse le code ...
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    opencode

$ git diff HEAD~1
# vérifier les changements récents

$ fg
opencode
# Le LLM reprend là où il s&#39;était arrêté&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avantaj iki katlı:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bağlam kaybı yok&lt;/strong&gt;: LLM oturumu, sohbet geçmişi, açık dosyalar — her şey korunur&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yeniden başlatma yok&lt;/strong&gt;: opencode&amp;#8217;i yeniden başlatmak, bağlamı yeniden yüklemek ve sorunu LLM&amp;#8217;e yeniden açıklamak gerekmez&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_senaryo_4_çok_sayıda_işi_aynı_anda_yönetme&quot;&gt;Senaryo 4 : Çok sayıda işi aynı anda yönetme&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; et `bg`Birden fazla proses askıya alındığında, belirli bir prosesi hedeflemek için bir iş numarası kabul ederler&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ vim config.yml
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim config.yml

$ ./gradlew test
^Z
[2]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew test

$ htop
^Z
[3]+  Stoppé    htop

$ jobs
[1]   Stoppé    vim config.yml
[2]-  Stoppé    ./gradlew test
[3]+  Stoppé    htop

$ fg %2
./gradlew test
# Le build reprend en avant-plan

$ bg %3
[3] htop &amp;amp;
# htop reprend en arrière-plan&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

rectangle &quot;Durdurulan işler&quot; as jobs #LightYellow {
  card &quot;[1] vim config.yml&quot; as j1
  card &quot;[2] ./gradlew test&quot; as j2
  card &quot;[3] htop&quot; as j3
}

rectangle &quot;Eylemler&quot; as actions #LightGreen {
  card &quot;fg %2
→ ön plan&quot; as a1
  card &quot;bg %3\n→ arka plan&quot; as a2
  card &quot;fg %1\n→ ön plan&quot; as a3
}

jobs --&amp;gt; actions : fg/bg + numéro de job
actions --&amp;gt; j2 : Reprend
actions --&amp;gt; j3 : En arrière-plan

note bottom of jobs
  Chaque job conserve
  son état exact
  entre les suspend/resume
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_i̇ş_komutlarının_özeti&quot;&gt;İş komutlarının özeti&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 20%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 40%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 40%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;sipariş&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;örnek&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Ön plandaki süreci duraklat&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gönderimi`SIGTSTP`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Varsayılan işi ön planda devam et&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;fg %1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Job n&amp;#8217;i ön plana getir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Arka planda varsayılan işi devam ettir&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;bg %1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;n işini arka planda sürdürür&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bg %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jobs&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Geçerli kabuğun işlerini listele&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jobs -l&lt;/code&gt;(PID ile)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;n işini tamamla&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill %2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_fg_bg_ctrlz_ctrlc_ve_arasındaki_farklar&quot;&gt;fg, bg, Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+C ve &amp;amp; arasındaki farklar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Çoğu geliştirici bu mekanizmaları karıştırır. İşte kesin bir açıklama.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

rectangle &quot;**Ctrl+Z**\nSIGTSTP&quot; as ctrlz #LightYellow {
  card &quot;İşlemi askıya al\n(hâlâ bellekte)\nfg/bg ile kullanılabilir&quot; as c1
}

rectangle &quot;**Ctrl+C**
SIGINT&quot; as ctrlc #LightCoral {
  card &quot;İşlemi sonlandır
(geri dönüş yok)
Tüm durumun kaybı&quot; as c2
}

rectangle &quot;**&amp;amp; **\n(arkaplan)&quot; as ampersand #LightGreen {
  card &quot;Doğrudan başlat
arkaplanda
Terminal anında boş&quot; as c3
}

rectangle &quot;**fg**
(ön plan)&quot; as fg_ #SkyBlue {
  card &quot;Bir işi getir
ön planda askıya alınmış
Terminal meşgul&quot; as c4
}

rectangle &quot;**bg**
(arka plan)&quot; as bg_ #Lavender {
  card &quot;Bir işi devam ettir\nArka planda askıya alınmış\nBoş terminal&quot; as c5
}

ctrlz -right-&amp;gt; fg_ : fg pour reprendre
ctrlz -right-&amp;gt; bg_ : bg pour continuer\nen arrière-plan
ctrlc -right-&amp;gt; c2 : Pas de retour\nprocessus tué

note bottom of ctrlz
  Le processus est **figé**
  mais **pas tué**
end note

note bottom of ampersand
  Alternative : lancer
  ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
  directement en arrière-plan
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 16.6666%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3333%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 16.6666%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 33.3335%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Kısayol/Komut&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Sinyal&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;etki&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Geri dönmek ister misin?&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGTSTP&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İşlemi durdur (donmuş, bellekte)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Evet :`fg` ou &lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGINT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İşlemi sonlandır (tamamlandı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır: süreç yok edildi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+\&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGQUIT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;İşlemi öldür + çekirdek dökümü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hayır: süreç yok edildi&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;commande &amp;amp;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;—&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Arka planda doğrudan başlat&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`fg`onu ön plana getirmek için&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt; est&lt;strong&gt;yıkmayan&lt;/strong&gt;. İşlem bellekte aynı şekilde dondurulmuştur. Hemen devam edebilirsiniz`fg`. Bu bir &lt;em&gt;pause&lt;/em&gt;, bir &lt;em&gt;stop&lt;/em&gt; değil.
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇şin_tam_yaşam_döngüsü&quot;&gt;İşin tam yaşam döngüsü&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

title Bir kabuk işinin tam yaşam döngüsü
state &quot;mevcut olmayan&quot; as none
state &quot;Ön plan\n(terminali işgal eder)&quot; as foreground #LightCoral
state &quot;Askıya alındı\n(Ctrl+Z / SIGTSTP)&quot; as suspended #LightYellow
state &quot;Arka plan
(bg veya &amp;amp;)&quot; as background #LightGreen
state &quot;Tamamlandı
(çıkış kodu 0)&quot; as done #LightGray

[*] --&amp;gt; none
none --&amp;gt; foreground : tape une commande
foreground --&amp;gt; suspended : Ctrl+Z
foreground --&amp;gt; done : fin normale

suspended --&amp;gt; foreground : fg
suspended --&amp;gt; background : bg
suspended --&amp;gt; done : kill %n

background --&amp;gt; foreground : fg
background --&amp;gt; done : fin normale\n(en arrière-plan)
background --&amp;gt; suspended : Ctrl+Z\n(si fg puis Ctrl+Z)

done --&amp;gt; [*]

note right of suspended
  L&#39;état suspendu est
  le pivot de tout le
  système de jobs
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇leri_düzey_ipuçları&quot;&gt;İleri düzey ipuçları&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_fg_ile_en_güncel_iş_ve_alternasyon&quot;&gt;fg ile en güncel iş ve alternasyon&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg`argüman olmadan işaretli işi getirir&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;(en son). Ama başka bir şey de kullanabilirsiniz.&lt;/code&gt;%-`önceki işi hedeflemek için :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ vim file1.txt
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim file1.txt

$ vim file2.txt
^Z
[2]+  Stoppé    vim file2.txt

$ fg      # ramène job [2] (le plus récent)
$ fg %-   # ramène job [1] (le précédent)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bir_işi_düzgünce_öldürmek&quot;&gt;bir işi düzgünce öldürmek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ jobs
[1]-  Stoppé    vim config.yml
[2]+  Stoppé    ./gradlew test

$ kill %2       # envoie SIGTERM au job 2
$ kill -9 %1    # envoie SIGKILL au job 1 (force)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_désown_kabuktan_ayır&quot;&gt;désown : kabuktan ayır&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;disown`Bir işi shell&amp;#8217;in işler tablosundan çıkarır. İşlem çalışmaya devam eder ancak daha önceki şekilde geri getirilemez.`fg&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
[1] 12345

$ disown %1
# Le processus continue mais n&#39;est plus lié au shell
# Ça survives à la fermeture du terminal&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_combiner_avec_nohup_pour_les_longs_processus&quot;&gt;Combiner avec nohup pour les longs processus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir işlemin terminal kapatma sonrası hayatta kalması için:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ nohup ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
[1] 12345
$ disown %1
# Le build continue même si vous fermez le terminal&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

rectangle &quot;fg&quot; as fg_ #SkyBlue {
  card &quot;Ramène le job\nle plus récent (+)&quot; as f1
  card &quot;Cible un job\nspécifique : fg %n&quot; as f2
  card &quot;Alterne : fg %-&quot; as f3
}

rectangle &quot;kill %n&quot; as kill_ #LightCoral {
  card &quot;SIGTERM (propre)&quot; as k1
  card &quot;SIGKILL -9 (force)&quot; as k2
}

rectangle &quot;disown&quot; as disown #Lavender {
  card &quot;Kabuğa ayrılır
(bağlantı kesilmeden hayatta kalır)&quot; as d1
}

rectangle &quot;nohup + &amp;amp;&quot; as nohup_ #LightGreen {
  card &quot;Processus immunisé\ncontre SIGHUP\n(survit à la fermeture\ndu terminal)&quot; as n1
}

fg_ -right-&amp;gt; kill_ : si faut\nterminer
kill_ -right-&amp;gt; disown_ : ou détacher
nohup_ -left-&amp;gt; fg_ : fg ramène en\navant-plan

note bottom of disown_
  Après disown, fg ne peut
  plus ramener le job
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_pièges_et_erreurs_courantes&quot;&gt;Pièges et erreurs courantes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_confondre_ctrlz_et_ctrlc&quot;&gt;Confondre Ctrl+Z et Ctrl+C&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu en sık yapılan hatadır.&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C`İşlemi öldürür.`Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt; le suspend. Si vous appuyez sur &lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C&lt;/code&gt; par réflexe, tout l&amp;#8217;état est perdu — fichiers ouverts, sessions LLM, builds en cours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

rectangle &quot;Ctrl+Z (SIGTSTP)&quot; as z #LightGreen {
  card &quot;Processus figé en mémoire&quot; as z1
  card &quot;fg le ramène intact&quot; as z2
  card &quot;Aucune perte&quot; as z3
}

rectangle &quot;Ctrl+C (SIGINT)&quot; as c #LightCoral {
  card &quot;Süreç tamamlandı&quot; as c1
  card &quot;État perdu définitivement&quot; as c2
  card &quot;Pas de retour possible&quot; as c3
}

note bottom of z
  Pause → Reprendre
end note

note bottom of c
  Kill → Perdu
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_les_jobs_sont_locaux_au_shell&quot;&gt;Les jobs sont locaux au shell&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;jobs&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; et &lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt; ne fonctionnent que dans le shell qui a lancé les processus. Si vous ouvrez un nouveau terminal, vous ne verrez pas les jobs de l&amp;#8217;autre.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;# Terminal 1
$ vim file.txt
^Z
[1]+  Stoppé    vim file.txt

# Terminal 2 (nouveau)
$ jobs
# (rien — les jobs sont locaux au shell)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour voir les processus system-wide, utilisez &lt;code&gt;ps&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;htop&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;ps aux | grep vim&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_les_jobs_ne_survivent_pas_à_la_fermeture_du_shell&quot;&gt;Les jobs ne survivent pas à la fermeture du shell&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si vous fermez le terminal, tous les jobs suspendus ou en arrière-plan sont détruits. Pour qu&amp;#8217;un processus survive, utilisez &lt;code&gt;nohup&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;disown&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;$ nohup ./gradlew build &amp;amp;
[1] 12345
$ disown %1
# Fermer le terminal → le build continue&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_les_processus_interactifs_et_fg&quot;&gt;Les processus interactifs et fg&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certains programmes interactifs ne se portent pas bien après un &lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;. C&amp;#8217;est rare mais ça arrive :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certains programmes qui utilisent des signaux (vim, htop, less gèrent bien &lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les programmes réseau longs (ssh, opencode) récupèrent généralement correctement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les programmes qui modifient le terminal (ncurses) peuvent parfois laisser le terminal dans un état inattendu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En cas de terminal corrompu après un &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;, tapez :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;reset&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_diagramme_récapitulatif&quot;&gt;Diagramme récapitulatif&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam ArrowColor #444444

title &quot;fg — Le tips qui change tout&quot;

rectangle &quot;**Problème**&quot; as problem #LightCoral {
  card &quot;Terminal bloqué\npar un processus&quot; as p1
  card &quot;Ouvrir un nouveau\nterminal = solution lourde&quot; as p2
}

rectangle &quot;**Solution**&quot; as solution #LightGreen {
  card &quot;Ctrl+Z → suspend&quot; as s1
  card &quot;fg → reprend&quot; as s2
  card &quot;bg → en arrière-plan&quot; as s3
  card &quot;jobs → voir les suspendus&quot; as s4
}

rectangle &quot;**Avantages**&quot; as advantages #SkyBlue {
  card &quot;Pas de perte de contexte&quot; as a1
  card &quot;Pas de redémarrage&quot; as a2
  card &quot;Un seul terminal suffit&quot; as a3
}

problem -right-&amp;gt; solution : &quot;La solution native\nUnix depuis 40 ans&quot;
solution -right-&amp;gt; advantages : &quot;Résultat&quot;

note bottom of advantages
  fg n&#39;est pas un tips obscur
  C&#39;est un mécanisme fondamental
  du shell Unix
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_pourquoi_fg_est_sous_estimé&quot;&gt;Pourquoi fg est sous-estimé&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La plupart des développeurs modernes découvrent &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; tard, voire jamais. Quelques raisons :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les IDE cachent le terminal&lt;/strong&gt; : VS Code propose un terminal intégré, mais les onglets multiples rendent &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; moins nécessaire en apparence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les outils graphiques remplacent les CLI&lt;/strong&gt; : les gestionnaires de fichiers, les moniteurs système, les clients Git graphiques&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tmux et screen&lt;/strong&gt; : ces multiplexeurs résolvent le même problème différemment, mais &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; est plus simple et toujours disponible&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pourtant, &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; est :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Universel&lt;/strong&gt; : présent dans tous les shells POSIX (bash, zsh, fish&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sans dépendance&lt;/strong&gt; : pas besoin d&amp;#8217;installer tmux ou screen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instantané&lt;/strong&gt; : deux frappes (&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt; puis &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;) pour suspendre et reprendre&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Préservateur de contexte&lt;/strong&gt; : l&amp;#8217;état du processus est intact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

rectangle &quot;Pourquoi fg est\nsous-estimé ?&quot; as why #LightCoral {
  card &quot;IDE avec terminal\nmulti-onglets&quot; as w1
  card &quot;Outils graphiques\nqui remplacent le CLI&quot; as w2
  card &quot;tmux/screen\nrésolvent le problème\nautrement&quot; as w3
}

rectangle &quot;Pourquoi fg est\nsupérieur ?&quot; as superior #LightGreen {
  card &quot;Universel : bash,\nzsh, fish, sh...&quot; as s1
  card &quot;Sans dépendance :\npas d&#39;installation&quot; as s2
  card &quot;Deux frappes :\nCtrl+Z puis fg&quot; as s3
  card &quot;Contexte préservé :\nzéro perte d&#39;état&quot; as s4
}

why -right-&amp;gt; superior : &quot;La simplicité\ngagne toujours&quot;
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_mémoire_technique_les_signaux&quot;&gt;Mémoire technique : les signaux&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour les curieux, voici les signaux impliqués :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 14.2857%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5714%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5714%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 28.5715%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Signal&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Nom&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Envoyé par&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Effet&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGINT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+C&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Interruption — termine le processus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGQUIT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+\&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Quitte avec core dump&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;18&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGTSTP&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Stop interactif — suspend le processus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;19&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGCONT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Continue — reprend un processus suspendu&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;15&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGTERM&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Terminaison propre&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;9&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SIGKILL&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;kill -9 %n&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Terminaison forcée (impossible à intercepter)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le flux complet :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

participant &quot;Utilisateur&quot; as user
participant &quot;Shell&quot; as shell
participant &quot;Processus&quot; as proc

user -&amp;gt; shell : Ctrl+Z
shell -&amp;gt; proc : SIGTSTP (signal 18)
note right of proc : Processus figé\nen mémoire

user -&amp;gt; shell : fg
shell -&amp;gt; proc : SIGCONT (signal 19)
note right of proc : Processus reprend\nen avant-plan

user -&amp;gt; shell : bg
shell -&amp;gt; proc : SIGCONT (signal 19)
note right of proc : Processus reprend\nen arrière-plan

user -&amp;gt; shell : Ctrl+C
shell -&amp;gt; proc : SIGINT (signal 2)
note right of proc : Processus terminé\nétat perdu
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusion&quot;&gt;Conclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt; n&amp;#8217;est pas un tips obscur — c&amp;#8217;est un mécanisme fondamental du shell Unix, disponible depuis les années 70. Le fait que la plupart des développeurs l&amp;#8217;ignorent est un symptôme de notre époque : les IDE et les multiplexeurs nous ont éloignés des bases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mais quand vous êtes sur un serveur SSH, dans un terminal minimal, ou simplement en train d&amp;#8217;utiliser &lt;code&gt;opencode&lt;/code&gt; et que le LLM est en plein travail — &lt;code&gt;Ctrl+Z&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;fg&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;bg&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jobs&lt;/code&gt; sont vos meilleurs amis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em&gt;_ Ctrl+Z suspend, fg reprend. C&amp;#8217;est la pause-play du terminal. &lt;/em&gt;_&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
