&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bağlam_ve_hedef&quot;&gt;Bağlam ve Hedef&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_başlangıç_noktası&quot;&gt;Başlangıç noktası&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proje`slider-gradle`Gradle eklentisi aracılığıyla AsciiDoc dosyalarından Reveal.js sunumları oluşturur.&lt;code&gt;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&lt;/code&gt;. Ana görevin yapılandırması`asciidoctorRevealJs`kök buildscript&amp;#8217;te doğrudan yaşıyordu`build.gradle.kts`(Empty)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;plugins { id(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&quot;) }

apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()

project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
    repositories { ruby { gems() } }
    revealjs {
        version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
        templateGitHub {
            setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
            setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
            setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
        }
    }
    revealjsOptions {
        // ... configuration complète
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_hedef&quot;&gt;hedef&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu tüm yapılandırmayı taşıyın`buildSrc/src/main/kotlin/slides/SlidesPlugin.kt`tüketici buildscriptinin şu şekilde daralması için:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti tamamen bağımsız olmalı: kendi eklenti bağımlılıklarını kendisi uygular, depolarını yapılandırır ve Ruby gem&amp;#8217;lerini yönetir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_i̇lk_engel_ruby_gems&quot;&gt;İlk engel: `ruby { gems() }&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_groovy_sözdizim_şekeri_ne_gizliyor&quot;&gt;Groovy sözdizim şekeri ne gizliyor?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Satır`repositories { ruby { gems() } }`Bu, yalnızca buildscript yürütme bağlamında mevcut olan Groovy DSL uzantısıdır. buildSrc’ten erişilebilen statik bir Kotlin API&amp;#8217;si olarak mevcut değildir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aramaya çalışırken`SlidesPlugin.kt`, derleme hemen başarısız olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_mekanizmanın_ayrıştırılması&quot;&gt;Mekanizmanın ayrıştırılması&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle önbelleğini analiz ettikten sonra (&lt;code&gt;~/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/rubygems/&lt;/code&gt;), dosyada keşfedilir`ivy-3.1.0.xml` :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-xml hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;artifact type=&#39;gem&#39; url=&#39;https://rubygems.org/gems/asciidoctor-revealjs-3.1.0.gem&#39; /&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`ruby { gems() }`aslında yapıyordu&lt;strong&gt;üç ayrı işlemler&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir Ivy işaret eden repo kaydetmek`https://rubygems.org/gems/`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grubu dışa çıkarın`rubygems`Maven depoları çatışmaları önlemek için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Yapılandırmada gem&amp;#8217;i kaydet`asciidoctorGems`JRuby&amp;#8217;nin çalışma zamanında bunu yüklemesi için&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu üç sorumluluk Kotlin&amp;#8217;de ayrı ayrı yeniden üretilmeli.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_üç_bölümlü_çözüm&quot;&gt;Üç bölümlü çözüm&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bölüm_1_ivy_deposu_rubygems_için&quot;&gt;Bölüm 1: Ivy deposu rubygems için&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.repositories.mavenCentral() {
    content { excludeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
}
project.repositories.ivy {
    url = project.uri(&quot;https://rubygems.org/gems/&quot;)
    patternLayout { artifact(&quot;[module]-[revision].gem&quot;) } &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;
    metadataSources { artifact() }
    content { includeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Uzantı`.gem`hardcode edilmelidir.&lt;code&gt;[ext]`varsayılan olarak içinde çözer&lt;/code&gt;.jar`, bu bir hata oluşturur`Resource missing`.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock note&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-note&quot; title=&quot;Note&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
Ivy deposu doğrudan üzerinde beyan ediliyor`project.repositories`ve bir blok içinde değil`repositories { }`çünkü bu bloğun alıcısı değil`RepositoryHandler`Gradle standartı ama bir grolifant API uzantıyla uyumsuz`ivy`Kotlin DSL.
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bölüm_2_asciidoctorgems_bağımlılığı&quot;&gt;Bölüm 2 : asciidoctorGems bağımlılığı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti`org.asciidoctor.jvm.gems`İlk olarak uygulanmalıdır — bu yapılandırmayı oluşturur.&lt;code&gt;asciidoctorGems`ve görevi`asciidoctorGemsPrepare&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.plugins.apply(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.gems&quot;)
project.plugins.apply(&quot;org.asciidoctor.jvm.revealjs&quot;) &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;

project.dependencies {
    add(&quot;asciidoctorGems&quot;, &quot;rubygems:asciidoctor-revealjs:3.1.0@gem&quot;) &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(2)&lt;/b&gt;
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Uygulama sırası önemlidir :`gems`önce`revealjs`. &amp;lt;2&amp;gt; Nitelendirici`@gem`Bağımlılığa doğru uzantıyı zorla.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bölüm_3_settings_gradle_kts&quot;&gt;Bölüm 3 : settings.gradle.kts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`dependencyResolutionManagement`içinde`settings.gradle.kts`proje&amp;#8217;lerin kendi depolarını beyan etmelerine izin vermelidir :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Suppress(&quot;UnstableApiUsage&quot;)
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.PREFER_PROJECT)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu satır olmadan Gradle, eklenti içinde bildirilen depoları yoksayar ve gemlerin çözümü başarısız olur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_bytecode_ile_api_introspeksiyonu&quot;&gt;Bytecode ile API introspeksiyonu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_neden_javap&quot;&gt;Neden &lt;code&gt;javap&lt;/code&gt; ?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eklenti`asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides`sürümde`4.0.0-alpha.1`. Belgesi yok veya eksiktir. Tek güvenilir kaynak derlenmiş sınıfların doğrudan incelenmesidir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_görev_hiyerarşisi&quot;&gt;Görev hiyerarşisi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sonuç :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask
  extends org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask
  implements org.asciidoctor.gradle.base.slides.SlidesToExportAware&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_forkoptionsın_keşfi&quot;&gt;forkOptions&amp;#8217;ın keşfi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İnceleyerek`AbstractAsciidoctorTask`[empty]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask | grep -i &quot;fork\|exec\|jvm&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bulunur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;final org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions javaForkOptions;
public void forkOptions(org.gradle.api.Action&amp;lt;org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&amp;gt;);
public static final org.asciidoctor.gradle.base.process.ProcessMode JAVA_EXEC;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_javaforkoptionsın_apisi_grolifant&quot;&gt;JavaForkOptions&amp;#8217;ın API&amp;#8217;si (grolifant)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`javaLauncher`bu görevde mevcut değil. Gerçek API`org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions`sunum :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public void executable(java.lang.Object);  &lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;(1)&lt;/b&gt;
public void setExecutable(java.lang.Object);&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;colist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;conum&quot; data-value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Yöntem`executable(Object)`atamayı değiştirir`executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;`derlemeyen (`val`yeniden atanamaz)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_revealjsextension&quot;&gt;RevealJSExtension&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`revealjs { }`bir görev yöntemi değil ama bir&lt;strong&gt;proje uzantısı&lt;/strong&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
  org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu şekilde erişilir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;().apply {
    version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
    templateGitHub {
        setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
        setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
        setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_java_toolchain_yapılandırması&quot;&gt;Java toolchain yapılandırması&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_javatoolchainservice_sorunu&quot;&gt;JavaToolchainService sorunu&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`JavaToolchainService`Proje uzantısı değildir. Aşağıdaki çağrı başarısız olur :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ERREUR : Extension of type &#39;JavaToolchainService&#39; does not exist
project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doğru API&amp;#8217;dir`serviceOf`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;import org.gradle.kotlin.dsl.support.serviceOf

project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
    setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)
    forkOptions {
        executable(
            project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()
                .launcherFor {
                    languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(17))
                    vendor.set(JvmVendorSpec.ADOPTIUM)
                }
                .get()
                .executablePath
                .asFile
                .absolutePath
        )
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_otomatik_docker_tespiti&quot;&gt;Otomatik Docker tespiti&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_bağlam&quot;&gt;Bağlam&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Asciidoctor/JRuby eklentisi Java 17 gerektirir. Kotlin 2.0.x, buildSrc içinde Java 25&amp;#8217;i desteklemez (sürüm ayrıştırıcı çöküyor`&quot;25.0.2&quot;`). Gradle daemonunun Java 17 üzerinde çalışması gerekir veya Docker kullanılmalıdır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_strateji&quot;&gt;Strateji&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker kullanılabilir → konteyner üzerinden çalıştırma`eclipse-temurin:17`(varsayılan davranış)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker yok + Java 17 → yerel yürütme&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Docker eksik + Java &amp;gt; 17 → açık hata&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val isDockerAvailable = try {
    Runtime.getRuntime().exec(arrayOf(&quot;docker&quot;, &quot;info&quot;)).waitFor() == 0
} catch (e: Exception) {
    false
}

val javaVersion = JavaVersion.current().majorVersion.toInt()

when {
    isDockerAvailable -&amp;gt; project.tasks.register&amp;lt;Exec&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
        group = GROUP_TASK_SLIDER
        description = &quot;Slider settings and generation (via Docker)&quot;
        dependsOn(TASK_CLEAN_SLIDES_BUILD)
        finalizedBy(TASK_DASHBOARD_SLIDES_BUILD)
        commandLine(
            &quot;docker&quot;, &quot;run&quot;, &quot;--rm&quot;,
            &quot;-v&quot;, &quot;${project.rootDir.absolutePath}:/workspace&quot;,
            &quot;-v&quot;, &quot;${System.getProperty(&quot;user.home&quot;)}/.gradle:/root/.gradle&quot;,
            &quot;-w&quot;, &quot;/workspace&quot;,
            &quot;eclipse-temurin:17&quot;,
            &quot;./gradlew&quot;, TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS
        )
        workingDir = project.rootDir
    }
    javaVersion == 17 -&amp;gt; {
        project.repositories.mavenCentral() {
            content { excludeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
        }
        project.repositories.ivy {
            url = project.uri(&quot;https://rubygems.org/gems/&quot;)
            patternLayout { artifact(&quot;[module]-[revision].gem&quot;) }
            metadataSources { artifact() }
            content { includeGroup(&quot;rubygems&quot;) }
        }
        project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;().apply {
            version = &quot;3.1.0&quot;
            templateGitHub {
                setOrganisation(&quot;hakimel&quot;)
                setRepository(&quot;reveal.js&quot;)
                setTag(&quot;3.9.1&quot;)
            }
        }
        project.tasks.getByName&amp;lt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&amp;gt;(TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS) {
            setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)
            forkOptions {
                executable(
                    project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()
                        .launcherFor {
                            languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(17))
                            vendor.set(JvmVendorSpec.ADOPTIUM)
                        }
                        .get()
                        .executablePath
                        .asFile
                        .absolutePath
                )
            }
            // ... reste de la configuration
        }
    }
    else -&amp;gt; error(
        &quot;Docker est requis pour exécuter $TASK_ASCIIDOCTOR_REVEALJS &quot; +
        &quot;avec Java $javaVersion. Installez Docker ou utilisez Java 17.&quot;
    )
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_nihai_sonuç&quot;&gt;Nihai sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tüketici_buildscript&quot;&gt;Tüketici buildscript&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;apply&amp;lt;slides.SlidesPlugin&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İşte bu kadar. Eklenti tüm sorumluluğu taşır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_settings_gradle_kts&quot;&gt;settings.gradle.kts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;pluginManagement {
    repositories {
        mavenLocal()
        gradlePluginPortal()
    }
}

plugins {
    id(&quot;org.gradle.toolchains.foojay-resolver-convention&quot;) version &quot;0.8.0&quot;
}

@Suppress(&quot;UnstableApiUsage&quot;)
dependencyResolutionManagement {
    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.PREFER_PROJECT)
}

rootProject.name = &quot;slider-gradle&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_tuzaklar_ve_çözümler_özeti&quot;&gt;Tuzaklar ve çözümler özeti&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 37.5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 37.5%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Sorun&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;neden&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Çözüm&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`ruby { gems() }`Kotlin&amp;#8217;de mevcut değil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Sadece Groovy DSL uzantısı&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Üç ayrı mekanizma : Ivy repo + Maven hariç +&lt;code&gt;asciidoctorGems&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Gradle bir`.jar`bir yerine`.gem`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`[ext]`onu çözer`jar`varsayılan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Hardcoder`.gem`Ivy desen + kvalifikatör`@gem`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;ivy { }`içinde derlemez`repositories { }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Grolifant alıcı Kotlin DSL ile uyumsuz&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Doğrudan arama`project.repositories.ivy { }`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;`javaLauncher`çözülmemiş&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Var olmayan özellik üzerinde`AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask`&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;setInProcess(&quot;JAVA_EXEC&quot;)&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;forkOptions { executable(&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;) }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;/code&gt; ne compile pas&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Propriété &lt;code&gt;val&lt;/code&gt; dans `JavaForkOptions`grolifant&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Yöntem`executable(Object)` à la place&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;JavaToolchainService&lt;/code&gt; introuvable via &lt;code&gt;extensions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Bu Gradle hizmetidir, bir eklenti değil.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;project.serviceOf&amp;lt;JavaToolchainService&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;revealjs { }&lt;/code&gt; non résolu dans la tâche&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Proje uzantısı, görev yöntemi değil&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Derleme Java 25 ile çöker&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kotlin 2.0.x ne parse pas les versions Java à deux chiffres&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Détection Docker automatique + fallback Java 17&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_yöntem_araştırma_javap_ile_bilinmeyen_bir_apiyi_okuma&quot;&gt;Yöntem araştırma: javap ile bilinmeyen bir API&amp;#8217;yi okuma&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_principe&quot;&gt;Principe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quand la documentation est absente ou incomplète, les bytecodes sont la source de vérité. &lt;code&gt;javap&lt;/code&gt; est l&amp;#8217;outil standard du JDK qui décompile les fichiers &lt;code&gt;.class&lt;/code&gt; en signatures Java lisibles, sans nécessiter le code source.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_étape_1_localiser_le_jar_dans_le_cache_gradle&quot;&gt;Étape 1 : localiser le jar dans le cache Gradle&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gradle télécharge toutes ses dépendances dans &lt;code&gt;~/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/&lt;/code&gt;. La première étape est de trouver le jar qui contient la classe à inspecter :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Résultat :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;/home/user/.gradle/caches/modules-2/files-2.1/org.asciidoctor/
asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides/4.0.0-alpha.1/.../
asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_étape_2_lister_les_classes_du_jar&quot;&gt;Étape 2 : lister les classes du jar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant d&amp;#8217;inspecter une classe, on vérifie qu&amp;#8217;elle existe bien dans le jar :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;jar tf asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar | grep -i &quot;RevealJS\|revealjs&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_étape_3_inspecter_une_classe&quot;&gt;Étape 3 : inspecter une classe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Cela révèle toutes les classes disponibles : &lt;code&gt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RevealJSOptions&lt;/code&gt;, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L&amp;#8217;option &lt;code&gt;-p&lt;/code&gt; affiche tous les membres y compris les privés. Le résultat montre immédiatement la ligne clé :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask
extends org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_étape_4_remonter_la_hiérarchie&quot;&gt;Étape 4 : remonter la hiérarchie&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La tâche étend &lt;code&gt;AbstractAsciidoctorTask&lt;/code&gt;. onu sırasıyla inceleyelim en localisant d&amp;#8217;abord son jar :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-[0-9]*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null

javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.AbstractAsciidoctorTask | grep -i &quot;fork\|exec\|jvm\|java&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;C&amp;#8217;est là qu&amp;#8217;on découvre &lt;code&gt;forkOptions&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;JAVA_EXEC&lt;/code&gt;, et &lt;code&gt;javaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt; de type &lt;code&gt;org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_étape_5_suivre_les_types_inconnus&quot;&gt;Étape 5 : suivre les types inconnus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;JavaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt; est une classe grolifant inconnue. On localise son jar :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;grolifant*.jar&quot; 2&amp;gt;/dev/null&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Puis on l&amp;#8217;inspecte :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath grolifant40-legacy-api-2.0.0-alpha.6.jar \
org.ysb33r.grolifant.api.v4.JavaForkOptions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On y trouve &lt;code&gt;executable(java.lang.Object)&lt;/code&gt; — la méthode correcte à appeler, par opposition à &lt;code&gt;executable = &amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;/code&gt; qui ne compile pas car c&amp;#8217;est une propriété &lt;code&gt;val&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_étape_6_vérifier_les_extensions_de_projet&quot;&gt;Étape 6 : vérifier les extensions de projet&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour &lt;code&gt;revealjs { }&lt;/code&gt;, la question était : est-ce une méthode de la tâche ou une extension de projet ? L&amp;#8217;inspection de &lt;code&gt;AsciidoctorJRevealJSTask&lt;/code&gt; ne montre aucune méthode &lt;code&gt;revealjs&lt;/code&gt;. On inspecte alors &lt;code&gt;RevealJSExtension&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;javap -p -classpath asciidoctor-gradle-jvm-slides-4.0.0-alpha.1.jar \
org.asciidoctor.gradle.jvm.slides.RevealJSExtension | head -5&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-none hljs&quot;&gt;public class RevealJSExtension implements groovy.lang.GroovyObject {
public static final java.lang.String NAME;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La présence de &lt;code&gt;NAME&lt;/code&gt; confirme que c&amp;#8217;est une extension enregistrée sur le projet, accessible via &lt;code&gt;project.extensions.getByType&amp;lt;RevealJSExtension&amp;gt;()&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_récapitulatif_de_la_méthode&quot;&gt;Récapitulatif de la méthode&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 75%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Étape&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Action&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;find ~/.gradle/caches -name &quot;*.jar&quot;&lt;/code&gt; — localiser le jar&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;jar tf jar.jar | grep NomClasse&lt;/code&gt; — vérifier que la classe existe&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;javap -p -classpath jar.jar NomCompletClasse&lt;/code&gt; — inspecter la classe&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Identifier &lt;code&gt;extends&lt;/code&gt; et remonter la hiérarchie&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;5&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Suivre les types inconnus dans leurs propres jars&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Chercher &lt;code&gt;NAME&lt;/code&gt; pour identifier une extension de projet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette méthode s&amp;#8217;applique à n&amp;#8217;importe quel plugin Gradle dont l&amp;#8217;API n&amp;#8217;est pas documentée ou dont la version alpha ne correspond plus à la documentation existante.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_prochaine_étape&quot;&gt;Prochaine étape&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce plugin buildSrc sera extrait dans un projet indépendant publié sur Gradle Plugin Portal ou Maven Local. Le buildscript consommateur deviendra alors :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;plugins { id(&quot;slides&quot;) version &quot;1.0.0&quot; }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Et &lt;code&gt;settings.gradle.kts&lt;/code&gt; sera réduit à son strict minimum sans référence à &lt;code&gt;foojay-resolver-convention&lt;/code&gt;, le provisioning JDK étant géré par le plugin lui-même ou documenté comme prérequis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;Table des matières&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_mimari_vizyon&quot;&gt;Mimari Vizyon&lt;/a&gt;
