&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_giriş&quot;&gt;Giriş&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teknik belge hazırlanırken, özellikle stil kılavuzları veya kullanıcı arayüzü spesifikasyonları için, renk paletleri göstermek sıkça gereklidir. AsciiDoc, belge hazırlama için çok güçlü olsa da, renk örneği göstermek için yerel bir sözdizimi sunmaz. Bu makale sorunu araştırır ve HTML enjeksiyonuna dayalı şık bir çözüm önerir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sorun&quot;&gt;Sorun&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kullanım_bağlamı&quot;&gt;Kullanım bağlamı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir web uygulaması temasının CSS değişkenlerini dokümantasyonu yapıyorsunuzu hayal edin. Şunlara ihtiyacınız var:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Onaltılık renk kodlarını listele&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her renk için görsel bir önizleme göster&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaynak belgenin okunabilirliğini koruyun&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JBake gibi statik site üreticileriyle uyumluluğu sağlamak&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor &quot;Teknik Yazar&quot; as writer
actor &quot;Okuyucu&quot; as reader

rectangle &quot;AsciiDoc Belgeleri&quot; {
  usecase &quot;Renk paletini belgele&quot; as UC1
  usecase &quot;Hex kodu göster&quot; as UC2
  usecase &quot;Renk görselleştir&quot; as UC3
  usecase &quot;Statik site oluştur&quot; as UC4
  usecase &quot;Dokümantasyonu incele&quot; as UC5
}

writer --&amp;gt; UC1
UC1 ..&amp;gt; UC2 : include
UC1 ..&amp;gt; UC3 : include
UC1 --&amp;gt; UC4
UC4 --&amp;gt; UC5
UC5 &amp;lt;-- reader
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_olası_yaklaşımlar&quot;&gt;Olası yaklaşımlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir AsciiDoc belgesinde renk göstermek için çeşitli çözümler düşünülebilir :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package &quot;Olası çözümler&quot; {
  component &quot;Unicode karakterleri&quot; as unicode
  component &quot;dış görüntüler&quot; as images
  component &quot;Özel CSS roller&quot; as css
  component &quot;HTML Enjeksiyonu&quot; as html
}

package &quot;Değerlendirme kriterleri&quot; {
  component &quot;Basitlik&quot; as simple
  component &quot;Taşınabilirlik&quot; as portable
  component &quot;Kişiselleştirme&quot; as custom
  component &quot;Bakım&quot; as maintain
}

unicode -down-&amp;gt; simple : ✓
unicode -down-&amp;gt; portable : ✓
unicode -down-&amp;gt; custom : ✗

images -down-&amp;gt; simple : ✗
images -down-&amp;gt; portable : ✗
images -down-&amp;gt; custom : ✓

css -down-&amp;gt; simple : ~
css -down-&amp;gt; portable : ✗
css -down-&amp;gt; custom : ✓

html -down-&amp;gt; simple : ✓
html -down-&amp;gt; portable : ✓
html -down-&amp;gt; custom : ✓✓
html -down-&amp;gt; maintain : ✓

note right of html
  Solution recommandée
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_1_unicode_karakterleri&quot;&gt;Seçenek 1: Unicode karakterleri&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unicode karakterlerin kullanımı gibi`&amp;#9632;`(■) basit ama sınırlı :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* ■ --accent-color: #7952b3 (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/strong&gt; : Renk üzerinde kontrol yok, sistem yazı tipine bağlı.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_option_2_harici_görüntüler&quot;&gt;Option 2 : Harici görüntüler&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Her renk için PNG veya SVG görüntüleri oluştur:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* image:colors/violet.svg[width=16] --accent-color: #7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/strong&gt; : Ağır bakım, dosya sayısının artışı, otomatik senkronizasyon yok.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_3_özel_css_roller&quot;&gt;Seçenek 3 : Özel CSS roller&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CSS sınıflarını tanımlayın ve AsciiDoc rollerini kullanarak uygulayın:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* [.color-violet]##■## --accent-color: #7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/strong&gt; : Harici bir stil sayfası gerektirir, tüm olası renklerin önceden tanımlanması.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_seçenek_4_html_enjeksiyonu_seçilen_çözüm&quot;&gt;Seçenek 4: HTML Enjeksiyonu (seçilen çözüm)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Makroyu kullan``HTML&amp;#8217;i satır içi stillerle enjekte etmek için :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;
background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;]
--accent-color: #7952b3 (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_html_enjeksiyonu_ile&quot;&gt;Çözüm: HTML Enjeksiyonu  ile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_çalışma_prensibi&quot;&gt;Çalışma prensibi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Makro``AsciiDoc, işlenecek ham içerik eklememizi sağlar ve bu içerik AsciiDoc işleyici tarafından yorumlanmaz. Bu, satır içi CSS stilleriyle doğrudan HTML eklememizi sağlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
participant &quot;Belge
AsciiDoc&quot; as doc
participant &quot;İşlemci
AsciiDoc&quot; as processor
participant &quot;pass:[] makro&quot; as pass
participant &quot;HTML
son&quot; as html

doc -&amp;gt; processor : Analyse document
processor -&amp;gt; pass : Détecte pass:[]
pass -&amp;gt; processor : Retourne HTML brut
processor -&amp;gt; html : Insère sans transformation
html -&amp;gt; html : Navigateur applique styles
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uygulama&quot;&gt;Uygulama&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İnjekte edilecek HTML yapısı şöyle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;
             width:1em;
             height:1em;
             background:#7952b3;
             vertical-align:middle;
             margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_css_özellikleri_açıklaması&quot;&gt;CSS Özellikleri Açıklaması&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 25%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 75%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Mülk&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Fonksiyon&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;display:inline-block&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Satır içinde kalarak width/height ayarlamanıza olanak tanır.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;width:1em; height:1em&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kare boyutu, font boyutuna göre oranı (duyarlı)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;background:#7952b3&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Görüntülenmesi gereken renk (ihtiyacınıza göre değişken)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;vertical-align:middle&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kareyi komşu metinle hizala&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;margin-right:0.5em&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Kare ile metin arasındaki boşluk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tam_örnek&quot;&gt;Tam örnek&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burada bir tema paleti belgeleme örneği:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;== Thème Clair

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#f8f9fa` (blanc cassé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#61428f;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-hover: `#61428f` (violet plus foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --card-bg: `#ffffff` (blanc)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aşağıdaki renderi kim üretir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Açık Tema&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --bg-primary:`#f8f9fa`(ekrü)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --text-primary:`#212529`(çok koyu siyah)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --accent-color:`#7952b3`(mor Bootstrap)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#61428f;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --accent-hover:`#61428f`(daha koyu menekşe)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; --card-bg:`#ffffff`(beyaz)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_optimizasyonlar_ve_iyi_uygulamalar&quot;&gt;Optimizasyonlar ve iyi uygulamalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_açık_renkleri_yönet&quot;&gt;Açık renkleri yönet&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Açık tonlu renkler (beyaz, çok açık gri) için, beyaz arka plana karşı görünür olmaları için bir kenarlık ekleyin:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-html hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;html&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;
background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #ccc;
vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;gri kenarlık (&lt;code&gt;border:1px solid #ccc&lt;/code&gt;) beyaz bir arka plan üzerinde beyaz kareyi sınırlamaya izin verir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_karelerin_boyutunu_ayarla&quot;&gt;Karelerin boyutunu ayarla&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İhtiyacınıza göre karelerin boyutunu ayarlayabilirsiniz :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1.5em;height:1.5em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Grand carré
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:0.8em;height:0.8em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Petit carré&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Birimin kullanımı`em`Karelerin yazı tipi boyutuna uyum sağlamasını garanti eder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_varyantlar_oluşturmak&quot;&gt;Varyantlar oluşturmak&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Özel ihtiyaçlar için farklı şekiller oluşturabilirsiniz:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_renkli_daire&quot;&gt;Renkli daire&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;border-radius:50%;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Cercle violet&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_renkli_kenarlı_kare&quot;&gt;Renkli kenarlı kare&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:3px solid #7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] Bordure violette&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çözüm_mimarisi&quot;&gt;Çözüm mimarisi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;@startuml
package &quot;Belgelendirme iş akışı&quot; {
  [Document AsciiDoc\navec pass macro] as asciidoc
  [Processeur JBake] as jbake
  [Site HTML statique] as html
  [Navigateur Web] as browser
}

asciidoc --&amp;gt; jbake : 1. Compilation
jbake --&amp;gt; html : 2. Génération
html --&amp;gt; browser : 3. Affichage
browser --&amp;gt; browser : 4. Rendu CSS

note right of asciidoc
  Contient les balises
  pass:[] avec HTML inline
end note

note right of jbake
  Préserve le HTML
  dans pass:[]
end note

note right of browser
  Applique les styles
  inline CSS
end note
@enduml&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_avantajlar_ve_sınırlamalar&quot;&gt;Avantajlar ve sınırlamalar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_avantajlar&quot;&gt;Avantajlar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Bağımsızlık&lt;/strong&gt; : Harici dosyalara bağımlılık yok&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Taşınabilirlik&lt;/strong&gt; : AsciiDoc tüm işlemcileriyle çalışır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Synchronisation&lt;/strong&gt; : Renk kodu doğrudan HTML&amp;#8217;de&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Esneklik&lt;/strong&gt;: Tam stil kişiselleştirmesi&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;Bakım&lt;/strong&gt; : Basit onaltılık kod değişikliği&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✓ &lt;strong&gt;JBake Uyumluluğu&lt;/strong&gt; : Statik site oluşturucular ile mükemmel şekilde çalışır&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_sınırlamalar&quot;&gt;Sınırlamalar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;sözüstü&lt;/strong&gt; : Tekrarlayan HTML kodu AsciiDoc kaynağında&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;Kaynak Okunabilirliği&lt;/strong&gt; : Kaynak belge daha az temiz&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✗ &lt;strong&gt;Erişilebilirlik&lt;/strong&gt; : Yerel olarak alternatif metin yok (manuel olarak eklenmesi gerekiyor)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_erişilebilirlik_iyileştirmesi&quot;&gt;Erişilebilirlik iyileştirmesi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kareleri ekran okuyuculara erişilebilir hale getirmek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;* pass:[&amp;lt;span role=&quot;img&quot; aria-label=&quot;Couleur violet Bootstrap&quot;
style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;
vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;]
--accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Özellikler`role=&quot;img&quot;` et `aria-label`yardımcı teknolojilerin görsel içeriği anlamasını ve tanımlamasını sağlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_somut_örnek_tema_dokümantasyonu&quot;&gt;Somut örnek : Tema dokümantasyonu&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burada, birkaç konuyu belgeleyen tam bir örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-asciidoc hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;asciidoc&quot;&gt;= Guide des couleurs de l&#39;application

== Thème Clair (`:root`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #ccc;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#f8f9fa` (blanc cassé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#7952b3;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#7952b3` (violet Bootstrap)

== Thème Sombre (`[data-bs-theme=&quot;dark&quot;]`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#212529;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#212529` (noir très foncé)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #999;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#ffffff` (blanc)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#0d6efd;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#0d6efd` (bleu Bootstrap)

== Thème Contraste Élevé (`[data-bs-theme=&quot;high-contrast&quot;]`)

* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#000000;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --bg-primary: `#000000` (noir)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #000;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --text-primary: `#ffffff` (blanc)
* pass:[&amp;lt;span style=&quot;display:inline-block;width:1em;height:1em;background:#00ff00;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:0.5em&quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/span&amp;gt;] --accent-color: `#00ff00` (vert vif)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sonuç&quot;&gt;Sonuç&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Makro üzerinden HTML enjeksiyonu``AsciiDoc&amp;#8217;un, teknik dokümantasyonda renk örneklerini görüntülemek için şık ve pratik bir çözüm sunması, biraz uzun olsa da, maksimum taşınabilirlik ve basitleştirilmiş bakım sağlar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu teknik, harici bir yapılandırma gerektirmez, ek bir stil dosyası gerekmez ve JBake ile tüm standart AsciiDoc işlemcileri ile hemen çalışır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;İlk renkli karenizi oluşturduktan sonra, sadece HTML kodunu kopyala-yapıştır ve onaltılık kodu değiştirerek hızlıca tam bir palet oluşturabilirsiniz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bu teknik, özelleştirilmiş görsel işleme gerektiren diğer kullanım durumlarına da genişletilebilir: simgeler, rozetler, basit grafikler veya stilin hassas kontrolü gerektiren her görsel öğe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_kaynaklar&quot;&gt;Kaynaklar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
