&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/pass/pass-macro/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;AsciiDoc Belgeleri : pass macro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
