&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çeşitli_kod_parçası&quot;&gt;Çeşitli kod parçası&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_harita_azalt&quot;&gt;harita azalt&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir bite listesini bir string listesine dönüştür ve string listesini özetle&lt;br&gt;
birleştirme içeren bir stringte requestBodyContent:byte[] içeren request gönderildiğinde nasıl loglanır?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;log.info(
    requestBodyContent!!.map { it.toInt().toChar().toString() }
        .reduce { request: String, s: String -&amp;gt; request + s }
)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_enum_ve_sealed_sınıflar&quot;&gt;enum ve sealed sınıflar&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;post:&lt;a href=&quot;0038_training_kotlin_enum_sealed_class_post&quot; target=&quot;&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;kotlin enum sealed sınıfı eğitimi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_fonksiyonel_arayüz_ve_metod_referansı&quot;&gt;fonksiyonel arayüz ve metod referansı&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bir varlığı, bir metod referansı (fonksiyonel stil- java 8) kullanarak DTO model domainine dönüştürebiliriz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;fun findAllByLoginNot(
        pageable:Pageable,
        login:String)
    :Page&amp;lt;UserDto&amp;gt; {
    return userDao.findAllByLoginNot(
                    pageable,
                    login).map(::fromEntity)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;birhttps://stackoverflow.com/a/22245383/837404[iyi açıklama]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_standart_çıktıyı_yakala&quot;&gt;Standart çıktıyı yakala&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;package functional

import java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream
import java.io.PrintStream
import java.lang.System.out
import java.lang.System.setOut
import kotlin.test.AfterTest
import kotlin.test.BeforeTest
import kotlin.test.Test
import kotlin.test.assertEquals


class BasicsHOF {
    private val standardOut: PrintStream? = out
    private val outputStreamCaptor = ByteArrayOutputStream()

    @BeforeTest
    fun setUp() = setOut(PrintStream(outputStreamCaptor))

    @AfterTest
    fun tearDown() = setOut(standardOut)

    @Test
    fun `three times dope`() {

        3.times { println(&quot;Hello&quot;) }

        assertEquals(
            buildString {
                repeat(3) { append(&quot;Hello\n&quot;) }
                deleteAt(length - 1)
            }, outputStreamCaptor
                .toString()
                .trim()
        )
    }

    fun Int.times(fn: () -&amp;gt; Unit) = (1..this).forEach { _ -&amp;gt; fn() }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_kotlinda_apply_run_let_also_use_ve_with_arasındaki_fark_nedir&quot;&gt;Kotlin&amp;#8217;da apply, run, let, also, use ve with arasındaki fark nedir?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kotlin fonksiyonlarının karşılaştırması ve Lambda Formları Kullanımı Referansı&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_uygula&quot;&gt;uygula&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Giriş Kotlin fonksiyonları`apply`, &lt;code&gt;run&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;let&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;also&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;use&lt;/code&gt;, et `with`Farklı nesneleri işlemek için farklı yöntemler sunarlar. Her biri kendi kullanım durumları ve davranışlarına sahiptir. Ayrıca, lambda referans biçimleri mevcut lambda fonksiyonlarına başvurarak kodu daha okunabilir ve yeniden kullanılabilir kılar.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fonksiyon`apply`Bir nesnenin oluşturulması sırasında onu yapılandırmak için kullanılır. Çağrıldığı nesneyi döndürür.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda referansıyla örnek :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val someObject = SomeClass().apply(::configureObject)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda ile örnek :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val someObject = SomeClass().apply {
// configuration des propriétés de someObject
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_çalıştır&quot;&gt;Çalıştır&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fonksiyon`run`bir nesne üzerinde bir kod bloğunu çalıştırmak ve kod bloğunun sonucunu döndürmek için kullanılır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda referanslı örnek :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result = someObject.run(::someFunction)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda ile örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result = someObject.run {
// bloc de code à exécuter sur someObject
// la dernière expression est renvoyée
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_let&quot;&gt;let&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fonksiyon`let`bir nesne üzerinde bir kod bloğunu çalıştırmak ve kod bloğunun sonucunu döndürmek için kullanılır.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda referanslı örnek :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result = someObject.let(::processObject)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Örnek lambda ile :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result = someObject.let {
// bloc de code à exécuter sur someObject
// la dernière expression est renvoyée
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_da&quot;&gt;da&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fonksiyon`also`bir nesne üzerinde ek bir işlem yapmak için kullanılır ve çağıldığı nesneyi döndürür.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Örnek lambda referansı ile :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;someObject.also(::performAdditionalAction)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;lambda ile örnek :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;someObject.also {
// action additionnelle sur someObject
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_kullan&quot;&gt;kullan&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fonksiyon`use`kullanılması gereken kaynaklarla çalışmak için kullanılır. Otomatik olarak fonksiyonu çağırır.`close`blokun sonunda.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;lambda referanslı örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;someResource.use(::useResource)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda ile örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;someResource.use {
// travailler avec la ressource
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_ile&quot;&gt;ile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;fonksiyon`with`Bir nesne üzerinde adını tekrarlamadan birden fazla yöntemi çağırmak için kullanılır ve son ifadenin sonucunu döndürür.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda referansıyla örnek :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result = with(someObject, ::processWithObject)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;lambda ile örnek:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result = with(someObject) {
// appeler des méthodes sur someObject
// la dernière expression est renvoyée
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lambda referans biçimleri veya blokları kullanarak`{}`, mantığı ayrı ayrı fonksiyonlara sarmalayarak, kodun okunabilirliğini ve yeniden kullanılabilirliğini artırabilirsiniz.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_let_fonksiyon_kotlinde&quot;&gt;let Fonksiyon Kotlin&amp;#8217;de&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;let, nesneyi üzerindeki yan etkilerle birlikte mi, yoksa girişteki ilk durumda mı döndürür, let&amp;#8217;e göre ?&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fonksiyon`let`Ancak, fonksiyonun dikkat edilmesi gerekiyor`let`çağrıldığı nesnenin başlangıç durumunu değiştirmez.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;İmza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;inline fun &amp;lt;T, R&amp;gt; T.let(block: (T) &amp;#8594; R): R&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;kullanım&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Fonksiyon`let`Bu, bir nesneye dönüşümler uygulamak ve bu dönüşümlere dayalı bir sonuç elde etmek için yaygın olarak kullanılır.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sonuç&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;fonksiyon tarafından döndürülen değer`let`Lambda ifadesi argüman olarak geçirilen ifadenin sonucudur, genellikle nesne üzerinde yapılan işlemlerin sonucudur.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 50%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Yan etkileri&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
